
~ start


if GameState.was_event_seen("gloves_disinfected")
	$> hide_node("Sprite2D")
	$> show_node("Sprite2D2")

	PLUM: The gloves look way better now! (happy)

	- Take them
		$> GameState.add_item("Gloves")
		$> GameState.mark_event_seen("gloves_taken")
		$> hide_node("Sprite2D")
		$> hide_node("Sprite2D2")
		The gloves were added to your inventory.
		=> END

	- Leave them
		=> END

else
	PLUM: Gloves! They look gross. (worried)
	VINCENT: They look fine. (thinking)

	if GameState.has_item("Rubbing Alcohol")
		- Disinfect the gloves
			$> GameState.remove_item("Rubbing Alcohol")
			$> GameState.mark_event_seen("gloves_disinfected")
			$> hide_node("Sprite2D")
			$> show_node("Sprite2D2")
			You pour some rubbing alcohol over the gloves.
			PLUM: All better! (happy)
			VINCENT: Drama queen... (smug)
			=> END

		- Leave them alone
			=> END

	else
		- Put them on
			You put on the gloves.
			PLUM: They feel weird... (worried)
			You feel something moving.
			PLUM: Ew! Gross. (scared)
			A bunch of tiny worms crawl over your hand.
			VINCENT: They're just worms... (scared)
			They start eating your flesh bit by bit...
			[scene=game_over]
			=> END

		- Leave them alone
			=> END